{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u3010Time Slowdown | One-Hit Kill\u3011</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use abilities to temporarily control time flow, parry at the perfect moment, and instantly eliminate enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197180/extras/329eb3c9dd36424109db8be32057d153.poster.avif?t=1753250688\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197180/extras/329eb3c9dd36424109db8be32057d153.webm?t=1753250688\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197180/extras/329eb3c9dd36424109db8be32057d153.mp4?t=1753250688\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u3010Reverse Time and Space | Dual Characters\u3011</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Freely switch between temporal identities and flexibly utilize different character skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197180/extras/b70cd57d9310d9a779aed9008174f403.poster.avif?t=1753250688\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197180/extras/b70cd57d9310d9a779aed9008174f403.webm?t=1753250688\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197180/extras/b70cd57d9310d9a779aed9008174f403.mp4?t=1753250688\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u3010Unique Mechanisms | Interactive Puzzles\u3011</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Scenes across different timelines feature distinct special mechanisms\u2014outsmarting enemies is more engaging than brute-force slashing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197180/extras/6161b5c53e588abdd01d78c0e2803228.poster.avif?t=1753250688\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197180/extras/6161b5c53e588abdd01d78c0e2803228.webm?t=1753250688\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197180/extras/6161b5c53e588abdd01d78c0e2803228.mp4?t=1753250688\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u3010Fragmented Narrative | Multiple Endings\u3011</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Encounter NPCs from various time periods; your choices will turn them into allies or foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197180/extras/5a960e24c5512b90150c1c2c34baa42b.poster.avif?t=1753250688\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197180/extras/5a960e24c5512b90150c1c2c34baa42b.webm?t=1753250688\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197180/extras/5a960e24c5512b90150c1c2c34baa42b.mp4?t=1753250688\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once the journey begins, the wheel of fate starts to turn.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3197180?t=1753250688","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3197180?t=1753250688","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197180/b51bda2b611eb69cf73055e789992b3c85b50bdd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753250688","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197180/b51bda2b611eb69cf73055e789992b3c85b50bdd